      <dc:description>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;This wasn't a gift. This dress was a declaration of war. Fortunately, Adora and Catra are well-versed in hand to hand combat.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;On several levels.&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
